{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/9298916/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛切りたい！ぬうぉぉぅおあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかバッサリ切ってやる！バッサリとな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事に書いたKERA!さんの撮影の...\n９月号って書いちゃったんですが\nあれは、「９月１６日発売」の１１月号でした(>_<)ごめんなさいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、それとはまた違うんですが\n今月１６日発売の１０月号の\nKERA! さんにもかずみんとみゅうみゅうと\nいこまっちとまっつんと載っています（＾∇＾）！\n良かったら、みてくださいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/9298916/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃、いつも持ち歩いていた\nタイムレンジャーさんのバック（＾∇＾）へへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未だに大切にしている。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/9298916/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クロノチェンジャーァァア！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私 ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この度、富士急さんと乃木坂がコラボ\nすることになり\nガイドブックを作るために、ナタリーさんの企画で、\n絶叫戦隊ハイランダーさんと夢の共演をさせて頂きました＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうなんです！\n前に、ブログの写真で周りを隠していたのはこのことっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/9298916/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃーん(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/9298916/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/9298916/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうだこの異様な光景！2.5次元じゃないか！でゅふ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正義について熱く語らせて頂きました。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえーいヾ(＠⌒▽⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"富士急さんでは、17日のライヴイベントを始め\n私たち一人一人がデザインしたスタンプでのスタンプラリーやら\n写真展やら、例のガイドブック無料配布やら\n色々とお楽しみが満載なので、\n是非、富士急遊びにきてください！\n私は絶叫苦手だけどヽ(；▽；)ノ\n優しい乗り物もたくさんあるから！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、明日はいよいよ...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうなるかはわからないし、\nまだ何も言うことは出来ないですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちにとって、大事な日になることは確か！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"精一杯がんばりますっ(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、おやすみなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/9298916/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/9298916/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/9298916/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/9298916/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/13/9298916/0010.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}